e_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/886539f94a765729b753156704d42658.avif?t=1758830104\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story of Friendship, Change, and the Ghosts of Who We Used to Be</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before she left, Abigail was the unspoken center of her friend group\u2014Chase, Dani, Joanna, Gabe, and Kate, her first love. Now, returning to Kiln, she finds them changed, just as she is. Some bonds have frayed, some wounds have yet to heal, and some things remain just as they were\u2014beautiful, complicated, and unfinished. Rekindle old friendships, uncover buried tensions, and decide what kind of place Kiln will hold in Abigail\u2019s life. Is this a return home or a final goodbye?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/1eb6d6aa8b821c05829315a40139b0cc.avif?t=1758830104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras_big/1eb6d6aa8b821c05829315a40139b0cc.avif?t=1758830104 width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abigail</strong> is a <strong>narrative-driven adventure</strong> about memory, change, and the way places shape the people who leave them behind. Featuring a <strong>richly crafted world</strong>, a <strong>unique evolving folk game</strong>, and <strong>a deeply personal story</strong>, it invites players to step into a town where art, history, and relationships are woven together\u2014one tile at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras/fc27fc5cdf0ed995a8a91b2c02a78424.avif?t=1758830104\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569410/extras_big/fc27fc5cdf0ed995a8a91b2c02a78424.webp?t=1758830104 width=1560 height